# LINE OA Admin Panel - Walkthrough & Verification

## Phase 1: Authentication & Dashboard
- [x] **Login**: Navigate to `/login`, enter `admin@example.com` / `password123`. Redirects to `/dashboard`.
- [x] **Dashboard**: Displays Stats Cards and placeholder Chart.
- [x] **Logout**: Click profile dropdown -> Logout. Redirects to `/login`.

## Phase 2: User Database
- [x] **Seeding**: Admin user exists in database (`Prisma Studio` check).

## Phase 3: Chat System
- [x] **Webhook**: Send "Hello" from LINE app -> Webhook receives event -> Stores in DB.
- [x] **Chat List**: `/chat` shows conversation with latest message.
- [x] **Chat Detail**: Click conversation -> Shows message history.
- [x] **Sending**: Type message -> Click Send -> Helper receives message on LINE.

## Phase 4: Broadcast & Queue
- [x] **Queue Setup**: Redis is running. `bullmq` queue is active.
- [x] **Broadcast UI**: `/broadcast` form allows entering text.
- [x] **Sending**: Click "Send Broadcast" -> Job added to queue -> Worker processes -> Message sent to all users.

## Phase 5: Automation & Products
- [x] **Products**:
    -   Create Product: "Test Item", 100 THB. Shown in table.
    -   Edit Product: Change price to 150 THB.
- [x] **Automation**:
    -   **Welcome Message**: Enable "Send Welcome Message". Unfollow/Follow OA. Receive welcome message.
    -   **Keywords**: Add rule "promotions" -> Reply "Check our site!". Send "promotions" in chat -> Receive auto-reply.

## Phase 6: Rich Menu & Advanced Broadcast
- [x] **Rich Menu Management**:
    -   Create Menu: "Main Menu", Upload Image (2500x1686), Set Areas.
    -   Set Default: Click "Set Default". Verify on phone.
    -   Link to User: Go to Chat -> Profile Sheet -> Select Menu. Verify specific user sees new menu.
- [x] **Advanced Broadcast**:
    -   **Flex Message**: Select "Flex Message" tab. Paste JSON. Send. Verify rich bubble receives.
    -   **Product Card**: Click "Insert Product". Select "Test Item". JSON generated. Send. Verify Product Card.

## Phase 7: Polish & Gaps (Final)
- [x] **Broadcast Scheduling**:
    -   Toggle "Schedule for later". Pick Date/Time.
    -   Send. Verify status is "SCHEDULED" in DB (or logs). Message should NOT arrive immediately.
- [x] **Tag Management**:
    -   Go to Chat sidebar.
    -   Add tag "VIP". Verify badge appears.
    -   Remove tag. Verify badge disappears.
- [x] **Real Analytics**:
    -   `/dashboard` now shows REAL numbers from database (Total Users, Outbound Messages).
    -   Chart displays generic activity (or 7-day message volume).
- [x] **Flex Preview**:
    -   In Broadcast Form, click "Test Send".
    -   Enter your User ID.
    -   Click "Send Now". Message arrives immediately (bypassing queue).
